Subject: [PATCH 11/32] feat: arena healers step behind cover from enemy
 casters while keeping LoS to partner

Only with Playerbots.ArenaPvpStrategies. Triggers when an enemy caster is casting at the healer or the healer is under 50% HP; samples 3 rings x 12 points, keeps the nearest reachable one hidden from the caster and visible to the partner. Healers also no longer walk out of cover to see their damage target.
